    "title": "New to Habbo?",
    "html": "<div class=\"portlet-scale gold\">\n<div class=\"portlet-scale-header\"><h3>New To Habbo?</h3></div>\n<div class=\"portlet-scale-body\">\n<div class=\"portlet-scale-content\">\n<a id=\"001\"></a>Habbo Hotel is a virtual community where you can hang out with friends, design your own unique space and create your own games and competitions. <br/><br/><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">To get started:</span><br/>1. <a href=\"http://www.adobe.com/shockwave/download/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Get Shockwave\">Get Shockwave</a> (it's free)<br/>2. <a href=\"client.action\" target=\"client\">Enter Habbo Hotel</a><br/>3. Create your Habbo and play!<br/><br/><a href=\"hotel/newusers/index.html\" target=\"_self\">Read more about Habbo Hotel</a>\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"portlet-scale-bottom\">\n<div class=\"portlet-scale-bottom-body\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
    "width": 215,
    "height": 215,
    "src": "/habbo-2006/components/welcome.html"
  },
  "news": {
    "title": "Hotel news",
    "html": "<div id=\"newsbox\">\n<div id=\"newsbox-header\">\n<h2>Hotel news</h2>\n<a href=\"hotel/news/rss.xml\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"_external/images.habbohotel.com/web/web-1.0.1_b39/images/promo_area/feed-icon.gif\"/></a>\n</div>\n<div id=\"newsbox-text\">\n<div class=\"newsitem\">\n<h3><span class=\"articledate\">[11/27/06]</span>\n<a href=\"hotel/news/space_exploration_complete.html\">Space Exploration Complete</a></h3>\n<p>\n\t\t\t\tWhat a long, strange trip it’s been…\n\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newsitem\">\n<h3><span class=\"articledate\">[11/20/06]</span>\n<a href=\"hotel/news/thankful.html\">Warm Thoughts for Thanksgiving </a></h3>\n<p>\n\t\t\t\tFeeling thankful? Tell us about it...\n\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newsitem\">\n<h3><span class=\"articledate\">[11/14/06]</span>\n<a href=\"hotel/news/tony_hawk_skatepark_competition.html\">Do you have the best Skatepark in Habbo?</a></h3>\n<p>\n\t\t\t\tEnter Tony Hawk's Downhill Jam Skatepark Competition and find out\n\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hr\"> </div>\n<div class=\"newsitem oldnewsitem\">\n<h3><span class=\"articledate\">[11/13/06]</span>\n<a href=\"hotel/news/megamechafallinfurni.html\">MegaMecha MegaFallin' Furni!</a></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newsitem oldnewsitem\">\n<h3><span class=\"articledate\">[11/4/06]</span>\n<a href=\"hotel/news/u2_questions.html\">Burning Questions for U2!</a></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"newsbox-footer\">\n<div class=\"promo-button\"><a alt=\"\" href=\"hotel/news.html\">More News</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
    "width": 311,
