ores-position\">2.</td>\n<td class=\"scores-name\">suplilhomie</td>\n<td class=\"scores-total\">179</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div></div><br/>\n<a href=\"games/wobblesquabble/high_scores.html\">More Wobble Squabble High Scores</a><br/>\n<a href=\"games/wobblesquabble.html\">Find out more about Wobble Squabble</a>\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bottom\"><div></div></div>\n</div>",
