  "happenings": {
    "title": "Habbo Happenings",
    "html": "<div class=\"maskbox snow darker\">\n<div class=\"headline\"><div class=\"headline-inner\"><div class=\"headline-inner-inner\"><h3>Habbo Happenings</h3></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"body\">\n<p><img align=\"left\" alt=\"\" hspace=\"5\" src=\"_external/images.habbohotel.com/c_images/album1554/extra_ss_snowflake1.gif\"/><a href=\"community/habbo_spotlight.html\">Staff Pick of the Week</a><br/>\nPick YOUR tree in <b>Sixty2's</b> winning room... </p>\n<p><a href=\"community/Never_Ending_Story.html\">Never Ending Story</a><br/>\n<b>bigbadboi</b> starts the new story and you'll never believe how it begins...</p>\n<p><img align=\"right\" alt=\"\" hspace=\"5\" src=\"_external/images.habbohotel.com/c_images/album1554/extra_ss_snowflake2.gif\"/><a href=\"community/habbotunes.html\">Habbo Tunes</a><br/>\nRead about what <b>XxfafaxX</b>, <b>xxAdahxx</b>, <b>Zmfunit</b> and <b>Pickles.x.x.</b> are listening to this week...</p>\n<p><b>Humid's</b> <a href=\"community/news/humid04.html\"> quiz will tell you more about your Habbo...\n</a></p>\n<p><b>jxe</b> <a href=\"community/news/jxe.html\"> lets you live out your Habbo fantasies...\n</a></p>\n<p><b>-::WazzeL::-</b> <a href=\"community/news/wazzel.html\">gets you into the spirit of the season...</a></p>\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bottom\"><div></div></div>\n</div>",
